{"content":[{"c":["RULER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["The term represents a number of different functions and translates 13 Hebrew and 3 Greek words. In a political sense, a ruler was one who exercised political control over a state (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.7.18","r":"2Chr.7.18","rawR":"2Chr.7.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.7.18","value":"2Chr.7.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 7:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.105.20","r":"Ps.105.20","rawR":"Ps.105.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.105.20","value":"Ps.105.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 105:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.23.1","r":"Pr.23.1","rawR":"Pr.23.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.23.1","value":"Pr.23.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Prv 23:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Pr.28.15","r":"Pr.28.15","rawR":"Pr.28.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Pr.28.15","value":"Pr.28.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"28:15"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Eccl.10.4","r":"Eccl.10.4","rawR":"Eccl.10.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Eccl.10.4","value":"Eccl.10.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Eccl 10:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.14.5","r":"Isa.14.5","rawR":"Isa.14.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.14.5","value":"Isa.14.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 14:5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.16.1","r":"Isa.16.1","rawR":"Isa.16.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.16.1","value":"Isa.16.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"16:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.49.7","r":"Isa.49.7","rawR":"Isa.49.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.49.7","value":"Isa.49.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"49:7"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.33.26","r":"Jer.33.26","rawR":"Jer.33.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.33.26","value":"Jer.33.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 33:26"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.51.46","r":"Jer.51.46","rawR":"Jer.51.46","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.51.46","value":"Jer.51.46"}],"t":"ref","v":"51:46"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Mic.5.2","r":"Mic.5.2","rawR":"Mic.5.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Mic.5.2","value":"Mic.5.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mi 5:2"},"), or a state that exercised control over a subject people (",{"href":"?bref=Judg.15.11","r":"Judg.15.11","rawR":"Judg.15.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Judg.15.11","value":"Judg.15.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jgs 15:11"},"). The usual term for ruler was “king,” but because of its unsavory associations, many in Israel preferred the Hebrew term translated “leader,” meaning “one placed in front.” For example, Samuel rejected the former term but used the latter (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.9.16","r":"1Sam.9.16","rawR":"1Sam.9.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.9.16","value":"1Sam.9.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 9:16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.10.1","r":"1Sam.10.1","rawR":"1Sam.10.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.10.1","value":"1Sam.10.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"10:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.13.14","r":"1Sam.13.14","rawR":"1Sam.13.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.13.14","value":"1Sam.13.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"13:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.25.30","r":"1Sam.25.30","rawR":"1Sam.25.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.25.30","value":"1Sam.25.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"25:30"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.5.2","r":"2Sam.5.2","rawR":"2Sam.5.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.5.2","value":"2Sam.5.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 5:2"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.6.21","r":"2Sam.6.21","rawR":"2Sam.6.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.6.21","value":"2Sam.6.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"6:21"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.7.8","r":"2Sam.7.8","rawR":"2Sam.7.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.7.8","value":"2Sam.7.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"7:8"},"). Other Hebrew words are translated “ruler” in the ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},". However, most modern translations prefer alternatives to this more generic term."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":["In the NT the Greek word regularly translated “ruler” refers to administrative or religious leaders (in various modern versions, see ",{"href":"?bref=Matt.9.18,23","r":"Matt.9.18,23","rawR":"Matt.9.18,23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.9.18,23","value":"Matt.9.18,23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 9:18, 23"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.8.41","r":"Luke.8.41","rawR":"Luke.8.41","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.8.41","value":"Luke.8.41"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 8:41"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.18.18","r":"Luke.18.18","rawR":"Luke.18.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.18.18","value":"Luke.18.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"18:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.23.35","r":"Luke.23.35","rawR":"Luke.23.35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.23.35","value":"Luke.23.35"}],"t":"ref","v":"23:35"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Luke.24.20","r":"Luke.24.20","rawR":"Luke.24.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.24.20","value":"Luke.24.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"24:20"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=John.3.1","r":"John.3.1","rawR":"John.3.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.3.1","value":"John.3.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jn 3:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=John.7.26,48","r":"John.7.26,48","rawR":"John.7.26,48","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.7.26,48","value":"John.7.26,48"}],"t":"ref","v":"7:26, 48"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=John.12.31","r":"John.12.31","rawR":"John.12.31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"John.12.31","value":"John.12.31"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:31"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.3.17","r":"Acts.3.17","rawR":"Acts.3.17","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.3.17","value":"Acts.3.17"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 3:17"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.4.5,26","r":"Acts.4.5,26","rawR":"Acts.4.5,26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.4.5,26","value":"Acts.4.5,26"}],"t":"ref","v":"4:5, 26"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.7.27,35","r":"Acts.7.27,35","rawR":"Acts.7.27,35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.7.27,35","value":"Acts.7.27,35"}],"t":"ref","v":"7:27, 35"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.13.27","r":"Acts.13.27","rawR":"Acts.13.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.13.27","value":"Acts.13.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"13:27"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.14.5","r":"Acts.14.5","rawR":"Acts.14.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.14.5","value":"Acts.14.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"14:5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.16.19","r":"Acts.16.19","rawR":"Acts.16.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.16.19","value":"Acts.16.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"16:19"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.23.5","r":"Acts.23.5","rawR":"Acts.23.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.23.5","value":"Acts.23.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"23:5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Rom.13.3","r":"Rom.13.3","rawR":"Rom.13.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rom.13.3","value":"Rom.13.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rom 13:3"},"). ",{"href":"?bref=Eph.6.12","r":"Eph.6.12","rawR":"Eph.6.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Eph.6.12","value":"Eph.6.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ephesians 6:12"}," mentions the rulers of the darkness of this world."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=King_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"King_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"King_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"King"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ruler","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Chr 7:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.7.18","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.7.18","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.7.18"},{"anchorText":"Ps 105:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.105.20","rawQueryValue":"Ps.105.20","sourceRefExact":"Ps.105.20"},{"anchorText":"Prv 23:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.23.1","rawQueryValue":"Pr.23.1","sourceRefExact":"Pr.23.1"},{"anchorText":"28:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Pr.28.15","rawQueryValue":"Pr.28.15","sourceRefExact":"Pr.28.15"},{"anchorText":"Eccl 10:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Eccl.10.4","rawQueryValue":"Eccl.10.4","sourceRefExact":"Eccl.10.4"},{"anchorText":"Is 14:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.14.5","rawQueryValue":"Isa.14.5","sourceRefExact":"Isa.14.5"},{"anchorText":"16:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.16.1","rawQueryValue":"Isa.16.1","sourceRefExact":"Isa.16.1"},{"anchorText":"49:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream"